WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:18.285
My plan was to invent a relaxing bubble bath soap that would help Molly sleep.

2
00:00:18.286 --> 00:00:22.334
Inventors call that "formulating."

3
00:00:22.335 --> 00:00:27.355
I had decided to formulate a special soap just for Molly.

4
00:00:27.356 --> 00:00:31.688
I couldn't wait to get started!

5
00:00:31.689 --> 00:00:37.263
When we got home, Molly asked her babysitter if she could go to my apartment.

6
00:00:37.264 --> 00:00:43.306
"Okay," said Lucy, who was watching TV with Caswell in the living room.

7
00:00:43.307 --> 00:00:49.158
"You're missing a great episode of Monster Madness!" Caswell told Molly.

8
00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:59.436
Sure enough, I could hear the roars of monsters and the screams of frightened people coming from the TV.

9
00:00:59.437 --> 00:01:03.541
"Let's get out of here," Molly whispered to me.

10
00:01:03.542 --> 00:01:07.978
A few minutes later, Molly and I were sitting at my kitchen table.

11
00:01:07.979 --> 00:01:12.867
Molly looked a little better, but she still seemed pretty upset.

12
00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:17.585
"I'm going to formulate a very special invention," I told her.

13
00:01:17.586 --> 00:01:21.093
"It will help you relax so you can sleep better."

14
00:01:21.094 --> 00:01:26.418
"I hope it works," said Molly with a sigh.

15
00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:33.142
"As soon as I close my eyes at night, a scary monster appears in my mind!"

16
00:01:33.143 --> 00:01:37.187
"Don't worry," I said. "My invention will fix that.

17
00:01:37.188 --> 00:01:40.369
What's your favorite food in the whole world?"

18
00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:42.365
Molly's face brightened.

19
00:01:42.366 --> 00:01:47.904
"Cherries!" she said. "I love cherries!"

20
00:01:47.905 --> 00:01:56.290
"Okay." I went to the cupboard and rummaged around until I found a bottle of cherry juice.

21
00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:59.238
Molly was watching me with curiosity.

22
00:01:59.239 --> 00:02:03.600
"Are you going to make me something to drink?" she asked.

23
00:02:03.601 --> 00:02:08.902
"I'm going to make something even better than that!" I promised.

24
00:02:08.903 --> 00:02:15.871
I got an empty jar and filled it up with soapy water.

25
00:02:15.872 --> 00:02:19.969
Then I poured lots of cherry juice into the jar.

26
00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.412
I shook up the mixture until it was all foamy.

27
00:02:23.413 --> 00:02:27.181
At last I handed it to Molly.

28
00:02:27.182 --> 00:02:29.325
"Here you go!" I said.

29
00:02:29.326 --> 00:02:34.410
"Your very own mixture of Enchanting Cherry bath soap.

30
00:02:34.411 --> 00:02:37.704
Pour it into the tub before you take a bath tonight.

31
00:02:37.705 --> 00:02:41.526
It will totally relax you before bedtime!"

32
00:02:41.527 --> 00:02:44.872
"Iggy!" yelled Tate from his room.

33
00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:48.105
"Get in here and get your stuff!"

34
00:02:48.106 --> 00:02:55.052
Boy, I couldn't wait until I formulated special bubble bath soaps so Tate could relax.

35
00:02:55.053 --> 00:02:58.302
But his favorite food is granola bars.

36
00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:02.959
Who wants to take a granola bar bath?

37
00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:07.964
I thought about Molly's Enchanting Cherry bubble bath all through dinner.

38
00:03:07.965 --> 00:03:12.883
I couldn't wait to hear about how my invention had helped her.

39
00:03:12.884 --> 00:03:18.971
I had just finished getting my stuff out of Tate's closet when the doorbell rang.

40
00:03:18.972 --> 00:03:22.457
"It's for you, Piggy!" Tate called.

41
00:03:22.458 --> 00:03:26.817
Sometimes my brother calls me "Piggy" instead of "Iggy."

42
00:03:26.818 --> 00:03:29.229
He does it just to get me mad.

43
00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.945
I didn't get mad this time though.

44
00:03:31.946 --> 00:03:37.599
After all, I'm the guy who invents things to calm people down, right?

45
00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:40.503
I went to the door.

46
00:03:40.504 --> 00:03:44.941
Molly was standing there in her bathrobe and slippers.

47
00:03:44.942 --> 00:03:48.211
"Iggy," she said, glaring at me.

48
00:03:48.212 --> 00:03:52.449
"I tried taking an Enchanting Cherry bubble bath!"

49
00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.712
"What's the matter?" I asked.

50
00:03:55.713 --> 00:04:01.965
"It was really sticky!" Molly cried. "And itchy!"

51
00:04:01.966 --> 00:04:06.838
"Uh-oh," I thought, watching her scratch her arms.

52
00:04:06.839 --> 00:04:12.999
I didn't want to say anything, but her skin looked a little red—as in cherry red.

53
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:18.081
My brilliant invention had obviously backfired.

54
00:04:18.082 --> 00:04:22.085
Suddenly Molly gave me a pleading look.

55
00:04:22.086 --> 00:04:24.242
"You have to help me, Iggy.

56
00:04:24.243 --> 00:04:28.367
I don't want to think about monsters again tonight!"

57
00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:30.096
My heart sunk.

58
00:04:30.097 --> 00:04:34.409
I needed a new idea, and I needed it fast.

59
00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:38.089
Or poor Molly would never get any sleep.

60
00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.544
I could do it.

61
00:04:39.545 --> 00:04:40.825
I knew I could.

62
00:04:40.826 --> 00:04:50.660
After all, I was Iggy the incredible inventor, and my best friend was depending on me.
